  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>empirical-bayes-rates</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{smoothed}{r_i}&amp;=\\term{weight}{w_i}\\,\\term{rate}{y_i}+(1-w_i)\\,\\term{pooledRate}{m},\n&amp;\\term{weight}{w_i}&amp;=\\frac{\\term{clampedVariance}{a^{+}}}{a^{+}+\\term{noise}{m/b_i}},\n&amp;\\term{rate}{y_i}&amp;=\\frac{e_i}{b_i}\\\\\n\\term{pooledRate}{m}&amp;=\\frac{\\term{eventSum}{\\sum e}}{\\term{populationSum}{\\sum b}},\n&amp;\\term{clampedVariance}{a^{+}}&amp;=\\max(\\term{priorVariance}{a},0),\n&amp;\\term{priorVariance}{a}&amp;=\\term{weightedVariance}{s^2}-\\frac{m}{\\sum b/\\term{count}{n}}\n\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">r_i = w_i y_i + (1 - w_i) m; w_i = a+ / (a+ + m / b_i) (0 where the denominator is not positive); y_i = e_i / b_i; m = sum e / sum b (pooled, not the mean of rates); a+ = max(a, 0) by default (clampPriorVariance true; false uses w = a / (a + m / b_i), esda parity); a = s2 - m / (sum b / n); s2 = sum b_i (y_i - m)^2 / sum b. Sums over the n included rows (unmasked, finite e, finite b &gt; 0); other rows are NaN.</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:empirical-bayes-rates-rates\" data-value=\"smoothed\">smoothed · output · smoothed</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:empirical-bayes-rates-rates\" data-value=\"weight\">weight · intermediate · weight</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:empirical-bayes-rates-rates\" data-value=\"rate\">rate · intermediate · rate</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:empirical-bayes-rates-partials-b\" data-value=\"pooledRate\">pooledRate · intermediate · pooledRate</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:empirical-bayes-rates-rates\" data-value=\"clampedVariance\">clampedVariance · intermediate · clampedVariance</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:empirical-bayes-rates-rates\" data-value=\"noise\">noise · intermediate · noise</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:empirical-bayes-rates-partials-a\" data-value=\"eventSum\">eventSum · intermediate · eventSum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:empirical-bayes-rates-partials-a\" data-value=\"populationSum\">populationSum · intermediate · populationSum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:empirical-bayes-rates-summary\" data-value=\"priorVariance\">priorVariance · intermediate · priorVariance</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.empirical-bayes-rates-compiled:empirical-bayes-rates-sum