  "formula": {
    "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{smoothed}{r_i}&=\\term{weight}{w_i}\\,\\term{rate}{y_i}+(1-w_i)\\,\\term{pooledRate}{m},\n&\\term{weight}{w_i}&=\\frac{\\term{clampedVariance}{a^{+}}}{a^{+}+\\term{noise}{m/b_i}},\n&\\term{rate}{y_i}&=\\frac{e_i}{b_i}\\\\\n\\term{pooledRate}{m}&=\\frac{\\term{eventSum}{\\sum e}}{\\term{populationSum}{\\sum b}},\n&\\term{clampedVariance}{a^{+}}&=\\max(\\term{priorVariance}{a},0),\n&\\term{priorVariance}{a}&=\\term{weightedVariance}{s^2}-\\frac{m}{\\sum b/\\term{count}{n}}\n\\end{aligned}",
    "ascii": "r_i = w_i y_i + (1 - w_i) m; w_i = a+ / (a+ + m / b_i) (0 where the denominator is not positive); y_i = e_i / b_i; m = sum e / sum b (pooled, not the mean of rates); a+ = max(a, 0) by default (clampPriorVariance true; false uses w = a / (a + m / b_i), esda parity); a = s2 - m / (sum b / n); s2 = sum b_i (y_i - m)^2 / sum b. Sums over the n included rows (unmasked, finite e, finite b > 0); other rows are NaN.",
